# FOLLOW-UP 2026-11-07 ~10:07 — rebuilt app (gate green, build at 10:01), both fixes in
App uninstalled first (drops the old container with the leaked Cache.db-wal
and the stale Keychain item) and the fresh .app installed, so a clean-slate
leak test: any hit would be a new leak.

